graph LR
    Start([Complex Goal]) --> Plan

    Plan[PLAN<br/>Break Into Steps]
    Plan --> Execute

    Execute[EXECUTE<br/>Run Current Step]
    Execute --> Evaluate

    Evaluate{Step Successful?}
    Evaluate -->|No| Replan
    Evaluate -->|Yes| Done

    Replan[REPLAN<br/>Adjust Remaining Steps]
    Replan --> Execute

    Done{All Steps Done?}
    Done -->|No| Execute
    Done -->|Yes| Final([Final Result])

    style Start fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff,stroke:#388E3C
    style Final fill:#2196F3,color:#fff,stroke:#1565C0
    style Plan fill:#FF9800,color:#fff,stroke:#E65100
    style Execute fill:#9C27B0,color:#fff,stroke:#6A1B9A
    style Evaluate fill:#F44336,color:#fff,stroke:#B71C1C
    style Replan fill:#00BCD4,color:#fff,stroke:#00838F
    style Done fill:#F44336,color:#fff,stroke:#B71C1C
